{"speciesId":271,"names":{"fr":"Lombre","es":"Lombre","en":"Lombre","ja":"ハスブレロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LOMBRE is nocturnal - it will get active after dusk. It is also a mischief-maker. When this POKéMON spots anglers, it tugs on their fishing lines from beneath the surface and enjoys their consternation."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LOMBRE’s entire body is covered by a slippery, slimy film. It feels horribly unpleasant to be touched by this POKéMON’s hands. LOMBRE is often mistaken for a human child."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"C’est un mauvais plaisantin. Quand il repère un pêcheur, il tire sur sa ligne pour le déranger."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"C’est un mauvais plaisantin. Quand il repère un pêcheur, il tire sur sa ligne pour le déranger."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit au bord de l’eau dans les endroits ensoleillés. Le jour, il s’endort sur un tas d’algues et ne se lève qu’à la nuit tombée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en el agua y, cuando hace sol, se queda en la orilla. De día duerme sobre las algas y de noche entra en acción."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water-grass by day and becomes active at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"日当たりの 良い 水辺に 住む。 昼間は 水草の ベッドで 眠り 日が 暮れると 動き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"C’est un mauvais plaisantin. Quand il repère un pêcheur, il tire sur sa ligne pour le déranger."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene carácter travieso. Si ve un pescador, tira del anzuelo para confundirlo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"釣り人を 見つけると 水中から 釣り糸を 引っ張り ジャマして 喜ぶ いたずらもの。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lombre est nocturne, il commence ses activités malicieuses et sournoises au crépuscule. Lorsque ce Pokémon repère des pêcheurs, il s’approche de leur ligne, tire dessus et se moque de leur regard perplexe."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lombre es, además de travieso, nocturno; entra en acción de noche. Cuando ve a gente pescando, se pone a tirar del sedal por debajo del agua y se divierte viendo la cara de enfado que se les queda."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lombre is nocturnal—it will get active after dusk. It is also a mischief maker. When this Pokémon spots anglers, it tugs on their fishing lines from beneath the surface and enjoys their consternation."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"夕暮れになると 活動する 夜行性。 釣り人を 見かけると 水中から 糸を 引っ張り ジャマをしては 喜んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Lombre tout entier est recouvert d’un voile visqueux et glissant. Toucher ce Pokémon est extrêmement déplaisant. On croit souvent à tort que Lombre est un enfant."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lombre está completamente recubierto por una película viscosa y resbaladiza. La sensación que produce cuando roza a alguien con las manos es muy desagradable. A veces se confunde a este Pokémon con un niño pequeño."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lombre’s entire body is covered by a slippery, slimy film. It feels horribly unpleasant to be touched by this Pokémon’s hands. Lombre is often mistaken for a human child."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体中 ヌルヌルした 粘液で 覆われ その 手で 触られると とても 気持ち悪い。 人間の 子どもと よく 間違えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon nocturne s’active au crépuscule. Il se nourrit d’algues qui poussent au fond des rivières."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon nocturno entra en acción al caer la tarde. Se alimenta del musgo que crece en el lecho de los ríos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"夕暮れどきに なると 活動を はじめる 夜行性の ポケモン。 川底の 水苔を 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit au bord de l’eau dans les endroits ensoleillés. Il s’endort sur un tas d’algues dans la journée et ne se lève qu’à la nuit tombée."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en las riberas bañadas por el sol. De día duerme sobre un lecho de plantas acuáticas y de noche entra en acción."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"日当たりの 良い 水辺に 棲む。 昼間は 水草の ベッドで 眠り 日が 暮れると 動き出す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":271,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",3],[6,"level-up",3],[7,"level-up",3],[8,"level-up",3],[9,"level-up",3],[10,"level-up",3],[11,"level-up",3],[12,"level-up",3],[13,"level-up",3],[14,"level-up",3],[15,"level-up",3],[16,"level-up",3],[17,"leve